<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God the Father’s the staff,</l><l>Christ the rock smitten for us,</l><l>Once stricken, water poured out,</l><l>Issued in the Spirit flowing</l><l>That we may have His life always.</l></lg>
</div>
